{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.CohomologicalEmbedding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.CohomologicalEmbedding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.GCD.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.euler_char_genus_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.euler_char_genus_4","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L131-L132","doc":"The Euler characteristic of Σ₄ is −6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.t211_not_embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.t211_not_embeddable","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L123-L129","doc":"No additional torus knot embeds at genus 4: T_{2,11} has Seifert\nrank 5, which exceeds g = 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cohomological_embedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cohomological_embedding","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L91-L121","doc":"**Existence of the cohomological embedding for the QOU.**\n\nThe QOU axioms force g = 4, and the six torus knots\nT_{2,3}, T_{2,5}, T_{2,7}, T_{2,9}, T_{3,4}, T_{3,5}\nexhaust H¹(Σ₄). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:cohomological-embedding","label":"prop:cohomological-embedding","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.spanning_rank_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.spanning_rank_eq","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L89-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.spanning_rank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.spanning_rank","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L88-L88","doc":"(iii) The 6×5 character matrix has rank 5 (= number of irreps).\nEncoded as: the number of linearly independent rows is\nthe total number of Hecke irreps. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.all_embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.all_embeddable","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L84-L84","doc":"(i) Each knot satisfies the embeddability constraint. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.knots","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.knots","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L82-L82","doc":"The list of embeddable torus knots. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.genus_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.genus_eq","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L80-L80","doc":"(iv) The genus is exactly 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.genus","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L78-L78","doc":"The genus of the moduli surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding.mk","kind":"ctor","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CohomologicalEmbedding","kind":"structure","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L56-L89","doc":"**Proposition (Cohomological Embedding).**\n\n(i)–(iv): The QOU axioms force genus g = 4, yielding exactly 6\nembeddable torus knots whose Jones polynomials span the space\nof knot invariants on Σ₄.\n\nThe proof requires:\n- Jones (1987) for the Markov trace and non-degeneracy,\n- Kassel (1995) for Hecke algebra representation theory,\n- The QOU axioms forcing SU₂ reconstruction (T_{2,3} embeds)\n  and color-squared strong force (T_{2,9} embeds).\n\nWe encode the four parts as fields of a structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.fiberDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.fiberDegree","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Fiber degree k (s = p^k for prime p). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.rank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.rank","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The Seifert rank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.coprime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.coprime","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Coprimality. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.s","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Second winding number s > r. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.r","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L46-L46","doc":"First winding number r ≥ 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotRep","kind":"structure","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L43-L54","doc":"Data for a torus knot representation on the moduli surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.embeddable","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L37-L39","doc":"A torus knot T_{r,s} is embeddable on Σ_g iff its Seifert rank ≤ g. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.seifertRank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.seifertRank","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding.lean#L32-L35","doc":"The Seifert rank of the torus knot T_{r,s}: (r-1)(s-1)/2.\nFor coprime r, s this is the genus of the Seifert surface. ","signatureChunk":0}]}